      "key": "bounded_step",
      "label": "Bounded step"
    },
    {
      "conditions": [],
      "definition": "Current state comprises material workspace state, authoritative inputs, justified knowledge and explicit unknowns. Work state records the workspace, governing basis, still-applicable closed results and judgments, residuals and external-effect uncertainty. An actor's context is an account of this state, not the state.",
      "exceptions": [],
      "grounding": [
        {
          "end_line": 126,
          "quote": "The current state is the material state of the workspace and\nits authoritative inputs, together with what is justifiably known about\nthat state, with the unknowns explicit. The work state of §5 records it:\nthe workspace, the governing basis, and the closed results and judgments\nthat still apply, with the residuals and the uncertainty over external\neffects as the explicit unknowns. An actor's context is an account of the\ncurrent state, not the state itself\n([§5](#the-workspace-and-an-actors-account)) (P3, P5).",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/ACTIVATION.md#ACTIVATION%2F1.%20The%20step%2FTransitions",
