          "end_line": 503,
          "quote": "A configuration allocates a task's responsibilities and information\nexchanges to frames; activation binds an actor to each frame (§2). It\nspans the task's work. The active frame configuration of\n[FOUNDATIONS §2](FOUNDATIONS.md#frame-objects) is the part of it used for\none evaluation or decision (P0, P6).",
          "section_id": "repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/ACTIVATION.md#ACTIVATION%2F1.%20The%20step%2FConfiguration",
