on claims, exhaustion proving neither completion nor impossibility (5,7,9). Added choices retain their owners: outcome authority for destination/acceptance, TICKETS for carriers, evaluation/scope owner for applicability/disjunction, design for configuration and declared subject laws, applicable law/grant for assessment/reserved acceptance, disposition owner for completion acceptance, Product policy for ambiguity/risk, accepted design for supported boundaries/threat model, specification owner for Z, tenant law for calculi, realization/granted actor for strategy, strategy owner for decomposition/order/concurrency, Product carriers for severity/priority and mandate owner for ongoing completion. SPEC_METHOD §8 applies these traces but retains ownership; its priority traces to F5/§6, results to F3/§3 and tenant binding to F10/§11. Consumers apply the owning rule without extending its determinations.",
