      "key": "construction_binding_accounts_strategy",
      "statement": "Bind A to actual workspace and its acquired account, external observations through owning interfaces, justified knowledge and unknowns; account may be stale/incomplete and is not the subject. Bind Z to the owning Product's governing WHAT across Intent/Product/Specification, with descriptions refining it and multiple realizations possible. Declared requirements/calculi govern lawful transformations/compositions but choose no outcome; lawful construction may fail or remain incomplete and proves neither delivery nor optimality. Premise-based proof retains premises/scope; paths may be discovered during work. Keep required conditions, observations and predictive models distinct: none establishes another, and model applicability/adequacy needs its own claim. Strategy serves Z within resources including context/attention/time/effort/computation/communication, feedback delay, uncertainty, integration and rework; planning/checking/coordination also cost. Measures state units/boundaries/composition and distinguish estimates/assumptions/observations. Incomparable objectives use owning tradeoff criteria. Granted actor/realization selects strategy with material rationale in existing records; superiority claims state objectives/comparison/assumptions. Context limits holding, attention limits use, frame selects step material/contract, and destination stays Z across activations.",
