      "statement": "Compose only compatible preconditions/effects/results/authority, preserving applicable outer obligations across decomposition/delegation/concurrency/recursion. Local success establishes end-to-end success only with coverage, compatibility and outcome evidence; chain obligations/categorical demonstrations retain FOUNDATIONS §4 ownership. Feedback follows observation/comparison/diagnosis/authorized response/action/reobservation; bugs use ordinary change intake/delivery. Diagnose defective realization, inadequate requirement/design, inaccurate model or insufficient observation separately; prediction error proves no outcome, model revision erases no counterexample and repairs no realization by itself. Preserve unresolved alternatives; supported repair belongs to cause owner, labels grant no class/permission. Severity concerns consequence, priority orders under outcome/dependencies/resources/authority; bug lists create no separate mechanism. Preservation, evidence-based progress, termination and outcome satisfaction require distinct support; formal induction/termination claims give premises/argument but no universal termination proof is prerequisite to bounded work. Continuing work needs supported purpose, possibly uncertainty reduction/hypothesis testing; repetition alone is not progress. Failure/missing information/uncertain effects/exhaustion use owned continuation/repair/recovery/re-entry/yield/stop; resume reacquires reality, preserves valid progress and resolves effects sufficiently before dependent action. Maintenance may continue under mandate; delivery needs completion conditions. Core evaluation preserves failure, coverage gaps and uncertainty; proof/checking/testing/use establish only scoped claims and required unavailable proof remains owed. Candidate, property proof and accepted delivery are separate. Completion needs sufficient Z evidence; exhaustion proves neither achievement nor impossibility, and changing Z leaves former counterexamples intact. Existing carriers suffice; relation adds no ledger, role sequence, runtime, general solver, fixed organization, convergence guarantee or categorical-universality theorem. Domain strategy/configuration/mechanisms/additional assurance retain their owners.",
