      "statement": "Derive allocation from operations, dependencies, available actor capabilities and assurance; these constrain but do not determine topology. Selecting design explains allocation, material resource limits under §6 and failure assumptions in existing design/frame/work records, with no separate carrier. Direct entry explains proportionally through intake, envelopes and stale/out-of-scope/re-entry conditions. Evaluate against task/dependencies/limits/authority/assurance, not labels/topology/familiar roles/coordinator presence. Preserve RF-009's distinct relation structures without additions or deletions. Frame selection grants no authority; every activation binds subject, result algebra, capability and admitted authority. Admission belongs to smallest existing authority owning the material decision; multiple owners retain decisions and no new authority is created. Proxies act only inside bounded grants; method/profile supplies actual owner binding.",
